  {
   "id": "b01-text-9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 752,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 71271,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 942561,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: compare with the cheapest path forced over the link",
   "originalText": "The rule: compare with the cheapest path forced over the link",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 847,
   "height": 22,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "all shortest paths X → Y avoid S→E   ⇔   dist(X,Y) < dist(X,S) + c(S,E) + dist(E,Y)",
   "originalText": "all shortest paths X → Y avoid S→E   ⇔   dist(X,Y) < dist(X,S) + c(S,E) + dist(E,Y)",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 198,
   "width": 981,
   "height": 128,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  The right side is the cheapest X → … → S → E → … → Y. It needs only the distance table: no path has\n   to be listed.\n•  Strictly less: then even the cheapest path over the link is more expensive, so no shortest path uses\n   it.\n•  Equal (a tie): some equal-cost path may use the link. That counts as \"uses the link\", the safe\n   choice.",
   "originalText": "•  The right side is the cheapest X → … → S → E → … → Y. It needs only the distance table: no path has\n   to be listed.\n•  Strictly less: then even the cheapest path over the link is more expensive, so no shortest path uses\n   it.\n•  Equal (a tie): some equal-cost path may use the link. That counts as \"uses the link\", the safe\n   choice.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 336,
   "width": 139,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Worked checks",
   "originalText": "Worked checks",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 370,
   "width": 798,
   "height": 123,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example  X → Y    Link     Left       Right                          Result\n-------  -------  -------  ---------  -----------------------------  ------------------------\n1        N → D    S→E      10         15 + 10 + 10 = 35              10 < 35  ✓  avoids\n1        S → D    S→E      20          0 + 10 + 10 = 20              20 = 20  ✗  uses (primary)\n1        E → S    S→E      10         10 + 10 + 10 = 30              10 < 30  ✓  avoids S→E\n5        L1 → L2  L1→SP1   20          0 + 10 + 10 = 20              tie      ✗  uses\n5        SP2 → L2 L1→SP1   10         10 + 10 + 10 = 30              10 < 30  ✓  avoids",
   "originalText": "Example  X → Y    Link     Left       Right                          Result\n-------  -------  -------  ---------  -----------------------------  ------------------------\n1        N → D    S→E      10         15 + 10 + 10 = 35              10 < 35  ✓  avoids\n1        S → D    S→E      20          0 + 10 + 10 = 20              20 = 20  ✗  uses (primary)\n1        E → S    S→E      10         10 + 10 + 10 = 30              10 < 30  ✓  avoids S→E\n5        L1 → L2  L1→SP1   20          0 + 10 + 10 = 20              tie      ✗  uses\n5        SP2 → L2 L1→SP1   10         10 + 10 + 10 = 30              10 < 30  ✓  avoids",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 503,
   "width": 932,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Row 3: E → S goes over E→S, the other direction. The test is per direction, like the metrics: c(S,E) may\ndiffer from c(E,S).",
   "originalText": "Row 3: E → S goes over E→S, the other direction. The test is per direction, like the metrics: c(S,E) may\ndiffer from c(E,S).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 553,
   "width": 950,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Row 4: L1 reaches L2 over SP1 and over SP2 (both 20). One of the two uses L1→SP1, so the answer is \"uses\".",
   "originalText": "Row 4: L1 reaches L2 over SP1 and over SP2 (both 20). One of the two uses L1→SP1, so the answer is \"uses\".",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
