   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Where it is used",
   "originalText": "Where it is used",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-text-37",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 770,
   "width": 303,
   "height": 105,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 293003,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 3874973,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "B2   ECMP: X = other next hop, Y = D\nB8   P-space: X = S, Y = each router\nB10  Q-space: X = each router, Y = E\nB15  TI-LFA walk, check (b): every\n     Prefix-SID segment X → Y\nA19  SRLG: once per shared link",
   "originalText": "B2   ECMP: X = other next hop, Y = D\nB8   P-space: X = S, Y = each router\nB10  Q-space: X = each router, Y = E\nB15  TI-LFA walk, check (b): every\n     Prefix-SID segment X → Y\nA19  SRLG: once per shared link",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-text-38",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 885,
   "width": 457,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 300922,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 3979702,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "LFA’s loop-free test (B3) is the same idea with the\npath forced through router S.",
   "originalText": "LFA’s loop-free test (B3) is the same idea with the\npath forced through router S.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-rectangle-39",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 553,
   "y": 714,
   "width": 533,
   "height": 229,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 308841,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 4084431,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-text-40",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 732,
   "width": 321,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 316760,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 4189160,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why a tie counts as \"uses\"",
   "originalText": "Why a tie counts as \"uses\"",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-text-41",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 770,
   "width": 496,
   "height": 85,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 324679,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 4293889,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "With equal cost paths, routers share traffic over\nall of them (ECMP). If one of them crosses S→E, some\ntraffic does too, so it can’t be counted on as a\nbackup.",
   "originalText": "With equal cost paths, routers share traffic over\nall of them (ECMP). If one of them crosses S→E, some\ntraffic does too, so it can’t be counted on as a\nbackup.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-text-42",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 571,
   "y": 865,
   "width": 484,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 332598,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 4398618,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The per-link view (A12) asks the opposite question and\nuses \"=\" on purpose: does some shortest path use it?",
   "originalText": "The per-link view (A12) asks the opposite question and\nuses \"=\" on purpose: does some shortest path use it?",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-rectangle-43",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1107,
   "y": 714,
   "width": 533,
   "height": 229,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 340517,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 4503347,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-text-44",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 732,
   "width": 124,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 348436,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 4608076,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Edge cases",
   "originalText": "Edge cases",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b01-text-45",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 770,
   "width": 496,
   "height": 128,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 356355,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 4712805,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  Parallel links (A10): c(S,E) is the metric of the\n   one link meant, not the bundle’s.\n•  Overload bit (A17): if S or E would be transit\n   and is overloaded, the right side is ∞.\n•  LAN (A21): S’s other LAN links are checked too,\n   as for an SRLG.",
   "originalText": "•  Parallel links (A10): c(S,E) is the metric of the\n   one link meant, not the bundle’s.\n•  Overload bit (A17): if S or E would be transit\n   and is overloaded, the right side is ∞.\n•  LAN (A21): S’s other LAN links are checked too,\n   as for an SRLG.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
