   "locked": false,
   "text": "To know whether X’s traffic to Y crosses the link S→E, compare dist(X,Y) with the cheapest path forced over that link. Strictly smaller means no shortest path uses it;\na tie counts as \"uses\", because ECMP may send some traffic over it.",
